ro correlation with BTC's next 1, 7 and 30-day returns, and price/flow divergences did no better than the base rate. The Coinbase premium had a modest edge in 2020-22 (premium weeks +2.5% next 7 days vs +0.7% in discount weeks) that has faded since 2023. Read this as who is in control now, not a forecast.","method":"Delta = taker buy volume minus taker sell volume, in BTC. Binance from 1-day klines (taker-buy field); Coinbase summed from every public trade (maker side 'sell' = taker buy). Each venue is judged against its own past year because Binance spot delta runs negative most days (median about -1.5% of volume), so a falling Binance CVD line by itself is normal. Buyers = 7-day net delta in the top 30% of the past year; sellers = bottom 30%. Premium compares Coinbase BTC-USD to Binance BTC-USDT closes.","errors":[]}